5.3 Audit watch list: ‘elpaca-build-augment-audit-watch’
========================================================

List of package symbols that get an automatic parity report against
‘package.el’ tarballs after Elpaca finishes building them.  Only
consulted when ‘(elpaca-build-augment-audit-enable)’ has been called.
See TEST.org (TEST.org) for details.

     (setopt elpaca-build-augment-audit-watch '(auctex ess eat))


